    "title": "Coffee Craze",
    "description": "You have a coffee mania? Jump into Coffee Craze, where you can show off your barista skills and enjoy a fun sorting game! Sort colorful boxes to make perfect coffee packs quickly. Hurry to serve tasty beverages, tidy up your caf\u00e9, and keep your customers happy. Get ready for an exciting sorting adventure in Coffee Craze!\r\nHIGHLIGHTS\r\n\u2022  Easy and relaxing gameplay.\r\n\u2022  Brain-training fun.\r\n\u2022  Match same color coffee to complete boxes.\r\n\u2022  Addictive and engaging sorting game\r\nCoffee Craze with very relaxing gameplay and exciting brain-training levels awaits!",
